Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.59,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.61,0:00:22.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:30.69,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:32.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:34.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.01,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:37.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
