Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:39.97,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, um pouco de história.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:42.46,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City não é novidade na série.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:45.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu em 2002, em GTA Vice City, presa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,nos anos oitenta, com terno pastel, neon e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,trilha de sintetizador.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:53.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Era a Miami dos filmes de crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:56.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Mais de vinte anos depois, a cidade volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:59.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que agora nos dias de hoje, com celular na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:02.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mão, rede social e todo mundo filmando tudo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.89,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.38,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA VICE CITY · 2002
