Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:32.39,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:34.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:37.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:39.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:41.88,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.02,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
