Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.08,0:02:01.48,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}art déco em Miami Beach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:16.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tem mais.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:19.28,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:22.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.26,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:27.21,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:30.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:30.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:33.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:35.24,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
