Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:38.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:41.80,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:44.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.64,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:48.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.06,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:57.29,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:57.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.84,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:03.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
