Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.01,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.18,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.27,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:46.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.63,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
